# ===== Datasets & large artifacts =====
# GitHub hard-rejects files over 100 MiB. data.zip is 329.6 MiB -> keep it out
# of git (Releases / Drive / S3). best.keras is 97.4 MiB, under the limit, so it
# IS committed so the repo runs out of the box (it only trips the 50 MiB
# warning; move it to Git LFS if the warning is unwanted).
data.zip
data/
*.keras
!best.keras
*.h5
*.weights.h5
*.tflite
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.ckpt
checkpoints/
logs/
runs/

